1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,800
RECUR • Reconstruct the state behind a failure.
Local fixture demo — real service and test executions.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,800
A $100 charge. A $40 prior refund. A flag-dependent bug.
Recur rebuilds the conditions and executes the request.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:39,800
First replay: mismatch. Observed flag restored: exact failure.
A model cannot override the deterministic verdict.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:54,800
Export the Reproduction Capsule.
Request, state, source hash, evidence, and expected failure.

5
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:23,800
Prove the fix: exactly one $60 refund.
The actual regression fails buggy code and passes fixed code.

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:38,800
Remove each causal condition.
Four ablations prevent the target failure.

7
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:51,800
Ten scenario checks. Missing evidence fails closed.
Separate gates test restarts, tampering, and 200 financial states.

8
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
From a one-off incident to an executable regression.
Capture the conditions. Recreate the bug. Prove the fix.
